The my355 build opens InputPlumber's virtual Xbox 360 pad through
SDL GameController. It does not use physical Flip button indices,
and it does not write cpufreq. zlyme-governor owns the clocks.

The streamer on PATH is moonlight-embedded from this image (/usr/bin/moonlight),
not the pak. See LICENSE in this directory (upstream pak license).
